        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        81.5599365234375,
        262.411376953125,
        98.2879409790039
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        102.06509399414062,
        174.30239868164062,
        115.485595703125
      ],
      "text": "Adherence to ART",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        126.64056396484375,
        513.4605712890625,
        139.9920654296875
      ],
      "text": "Adherence among children is a special challenge. The limited choice of paediatric",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        142.6370849609375,
        513.4835815429688,
        155.98858642578125
      ],
      "text": "formulations, poor palatability of liquid formulations, high pill or liquid volume burden,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        158.63360595703125,
        513.4719848632812,
        171.985107421875
      ],
      "text": "large pill size, frequent dosing requirements, dietary restrictions, loss of primary",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        174.630126953125,
        513.4602661132812,
        187.98162841796875
      ],
      "text": "caregiver, difficulties in swallowing tablets and adverse effects may all affect adherence.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        190.62664794921875,
        513.4374389648438,
        203.9781494140625
      ],
      "text": "Successfully treating a child requires the commitment and involvement of a responsible",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        206.6231689453125,
        513.4489135742188,
        219.97467041015625
      ],
      "text": "caregiver. Parents and other family members of children living with HIV may themselves",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        222.61968994140625,
        513.4605102539062,
        235.97119140625
      ],
      "text": "be living with HIV; suboptimal HIV care and treatment for family members could result",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        238.54721069335938,
        263.11688232421875,
        251.96771240234375
      ],
      "text": "(13) in suboptimal care for the child  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        263.0537414550781,
        315.8903503417969,
        276.4742431640625
      ],
      "text": "Immune reconstitution inflammatory syndrome",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        287.62921142578125,
        513.448974609375,
        300.980712890625
      ],
      "text": "Sometimes known as a paradoxical reaction, immune reconstitution inflammatory",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        303.625732421875,
        513.4259643554688,
        316.97723388671875
      ],
      "text": "syndrome (IRIS) is a temporary clinical deterioration that may occur within 3 months of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        319.6222229003906,
        513.4029541015625,
        332.9737243652344
      ],
      "text": "starting ART and most commonly within the first month. It is the result of reconstitution",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        335.61871337890625,
        513.448974609375,
        348.97021484375
      ],
      "text": "of cell-mediated immunity in response to mycobacterial antigens and can give rise to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        351.6152038574219,
        513.448974609375,
        364.9667053222656
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic and management challenges. Immune reconstitution can also occur with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        367.6116943359375,
        513.4028930664062,
        380.96319580078125
      ],
      "text": "improved nutritional status during anti-TB treatment. It can simulate worsening of TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        383.6081848144531,
        513.4719848632812,
        396.9596862792969
      ],
      "text": "disease, with fever and increased size of lymph nodes or tuberculomas. Risk factors",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        399.60467529296875,
        513.4260864257812,
        412.9561767578125
      ],
      "text": "for IRIS include low baseline CD4 count, extensive TB, early initiation of ART, and rapid",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        415.6011657714844,
        513.4144897460938,
        428.9526672363281
      ],
      "text": "immunological and virological responses to ART. Though a cause of significant morbidity,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        431.59765625,
        440.5158996582031,
        444.94915771484375
      ],
      "text": "TB-IRIS and BCG-IRIS are not associated with an increased mortality risk.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        456.1041564941406,
        350.9309997558594,
        469.4556579589844
      ],
      "text": "With respect to TB, there are two main presentations:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        478.4538269042969,
        513.4215698242188,
        491.9203186035156
      ],
      "text": "exacerbation of known TB disease in a child living with HIV who started anti-TB  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        492.2538146972656,
        232.31541442871094,
        505.6053161621094
      ],
      "text": "treatment and ART; or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        512.322998046875,
        364.0249328613281,
        525.7894897460938
      ],
      "text": "development of TB disease in a child starting ART. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        533.9889526367188,
        513.4215087890625,
        547.3404541015625
      ],
      "text": "In all cases, anti-TB treatment should be continued; the addition of corticosteroids may",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        549.9854736328125,
        513.4215698242188,
        563.3369750976562
      ],
      "text": "sometimes be useful. If there is any doubt, the child should be referred to the next level",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        565.9819946289062,
        121.88089752197266,
        579.33349609375
      ],
      "text": "of care.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
